WEBVTT

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.966
Open the first pending price change using the keyboard.

00:00:01.966 --> 00:00:05.053
Enter approves this price and moves focus to the next approval.

00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:07.013
Undo restores the last product and its place in the queue.

00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:10.970
Escape closes the sheet and returns focus to the restored row.
